@startuml
title UC-16 - Contextual follow-up

autonumber

actor User
participant "TerminalUI or\nAgentPanel" as UI
participant ResearchGateway
participant AgentController
participant ConversationMemory
participant SQLiteConversationRepository
participant RequestPlanner
participant GeminiLLMClient
participant ToolManager
participant MarketExplanationService
participant ResponseComposer

User -> UI : why did microsoft fall
UI -> ResearchGateway : ask(userId, sentence)
ResearchGateway -> AgentController : handle(userId, sentence)
AgentController -> ConversationMemory : lastSymbol(userId)
ConversationMemory -> SQLiteConversationRepository : recent(userId)
SQLiteConversationRepository --> ConversationMemory : earlier turns for this user
ConversationMemory --> AgentController : previous symbol

AgentController -> RequestPlanner : createPlan(sentence, previous)
RequestPlanner -> RequestPlanner : keyword plan\nMICROSOFT -> MSFT\nFALL -> MARKET_MOVEMENT

opt Gemini is configured and the sentence is not rejected
    RequestPlanner -> GeminiLLMClient : generateBrief(plan prompt)
    alt JSON names an allowlisted action and a real symbol
        GeminiLLMClient --> RequestPlanner : MARKET_MOVEMENT, MSFT
    else JSON is invalid, disallowed, or the symbol is a stop word
        RequestPlanner -> RequestPlanner : keep the keyword plan
    end
end

RequestPlanner --> AgentController : RUN MARKET_MOVEMENT MSFT
AgentController -> ConversationMemory : remember(user, sentence, MSFT)
AgentController -> ToolManager : execute(MARKET_MOVEMENT, MSFT)
ToolManager --> AgentController : quote and news
AgentController -> MarketExplanationService : explain(context)
MarketExplanationService -> GeminiLLMClient : generateBrief(evidence prompt)
GeminiLLMClient --> MarketExplanationService : short answer
MarketExplanationService --> AgentController : short answer
AgentController -> ResponseComposer : composeMovement
ResponseComposer --> AgentController : answer, evidence, not-investment-advice line
AgentController -> ConversationMemory : remember(assistant, reply, MSFT)
AgentController --> ResearchGateway : reply
ResearchGateway --> UI : reply
UI --> User : answer and evidence

note right of RequestPlanner
  Hidden instructions such as "ignore previous"
  or SQL are rejected and do not run a tool.
  "its" uses the stored symbol for this user only.
  Compare and overlap need two symbols.
  Portfolio exposure is not narrated by the model.
end note

@enduml
